# Public Repo Safety

- Never commit raw data files, archives, model binaries, database files, or secrets.
- Allowed commit scope for this project: notebooks, evaluation scripts, and documentation.
- Before every commit, check staged files against denylist from `.gitignore`.
- If any denylisted file is staged, unstage it and stop the commit until cleaned.
- When in doubt, ask for confirmation before staging borderline files.
